        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.8"
        ],
        "text": "八、內服液劑之使用原則：(94/11/1、97/3/1、97/12 /1)"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 1,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.8"
        ],
        "text": "（一）12歲(含)以下兒童得使用內服液劑(97/3/1)。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 2,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.8"
        ],
        "text": "（二）不適合服用固型製劑之病人，如施行管灌飲食等，得依病情需要使用內服液劑(97/12/1)。"
      },
      {
        "block_kind": "paragraph",
        "block_order": 3,
        "render_kind": "subsection",
        "structural_path": [
          "chapter:00",
          "0.8"
        ],
        "text": "（三）非為兒童或吞嚥困難患者所設計之內服液劑，得依病情需要使用(97/12/1)。"
      }
    ],
    "legal_effective_status": "not_claimed",
